  border:1px solid var(--accent); border-radius:999px; padding:.1rem .6rem; }\0a</style>\0a</head>\0a<body>\0a<div class=\22wrap\22>\0a<header>\0a<span class=\22tag\22>clean-server</span>\0a<h1>No route for that path.</h1>\0a<p class=\22sub\22>Served from a WebAssembly component through the clean:host contract.</p>\0a<nav>\0a<a href=\22/\22>Home</a>\0a<a href=\22/about\22>About</a>\0a<a href=\22/posts/hello-world\22>A post</a>\0a<a href=\22/missing\22>404</a>\0a</nav>\0a</header>\0a<div class=\22card\22>\0a<h2>404</h2>\0a<p>The guest registered no handler for this path, so it set status 404 and\0arendered this page. The host did not invent an error document.</p>\0a</div>\0a<footer>clean-server &middot; wasmtime component model &middot; no framework in the request path</footer>\0a</div>\0a</body>\0a</html>\0a")
